<header><p class="st-kicker">chiefdom · France and the Low Countries</p><h1 class="st-title">Triboci</h1><p class="st-meta">70 BCE – 51 BCE (approx.) · capital Brocomagus</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">Germanic people who crossed the Rhine with Ariovistus and settled in northern Alsace around Brumath.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The Triboci appear in Caesar's account of the battle against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ariovistus">Ariovistus</a> in 58 BCE as one of the peoples in his army. They had settled on the left bank of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhine">Rhine</a>, in land previously held by the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/mediomatrici">Mediomatrici</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Nothing is known of their institutions. They seem to have adopted Gallic ways quickly after settling west of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhine">Rhine</a>.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>After Caesar's victory over <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ariovistus">Ariovistus</a> they remained in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alsace">Alsace</a>. Under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> they formed a civitas with its chief town at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/brumath">Brocomagus</a> (Brumath), north of <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/free-imperial-city-of-strasbourg">Strasbourg</a>.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/triboci.jpg" alt="Triboci" width="320" height="325"><figcaption>Image: Feitscherg · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Map_Gallia_Tribes_Towns.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>70 BCE – 51 BCE (approx.)</dd><dt>Century</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/1st-century-bce">1st century BCE</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>chiefdom</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>tribal</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Brocomagus</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/france">France</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Tribocci</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=-60&amp;focus=triboci" aria-label="Triboci on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4757 511 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Triboci lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5304 942h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5077 767h0"/><path class="map-dot-ap" d="M5077 767h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>Location approximate: shown in present-day France. <a href="/atlas?year=-60&amp;focus=triboci">On the atlas &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></aside></div>

